5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best to help the village.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Nice to meet you all. I believe we should observe each other's speech patterns carefully before making any hasty accusations.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,How cautious. I'm sure some of us are already sweating under the pressure. Let's see who cracks first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not sweating! I'll find the werewolf and kick them out of here myself!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Let's stay calm. We need a logical approach. Rushing into things usually leads to mistakes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, do you think it's better to keep our roles secret for a while?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, the werewolf will simply eliminate them tonight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your enthusiasm is charming, but bravery without a plan is just recklessness.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Shut up! I can tell who's lying just by looking at them!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Instincts are unreliable. We should focus on contradictions in our statements as the days progress.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Ryuji. We should look for things that don't add up.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I've noticed that some are more aggressive than others. It could be a tactic to deflect suspicion.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,Or perhaps some are just naturally loud. It's quite a diverse group we have here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not using a tactic! I'm just being honest!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Honesty is subjective in this game. We must rely on verifiable information.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll do my best to find the truth.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see what happens after the first night.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
