35,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I have some information. I think... I think Ryuji might be the werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That was fast. @Daisuke, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, a bold claim right out of the gate. How convenient for the werewolf to pretend to be the Seer.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I knew it! Daisuke is brave for saying it! Ryuji, what do you have to say?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,This is an illogical leap. Daisuke is likely the werewolf trying to frame me to secure an early win.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I really am the Seer! I checked Ryuji last night!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is the werewolf, he's taking a huge risk by claiming Seer so early.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Or he's just desperate. @Daisuke, why should we trust a timid boy over Ryuji's logic?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Because he's telling the truth! Ryuji is just trying to act all smart to trick us!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply pointing out the lack of evidence. Anyone can claim to be the Seer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,Please... believe me. I don't want any more of us to die.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Ryuji's reaction is very composed, perhaps too composed. But Shunichi is defending him quite strongly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm not defending him; I'm analyzing the probability. Daisuke's claim is the most suspicious thing here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're acting just like Ryuji! You're both suspicious now!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Attacking me because I'm calm is not a logical argument, Takumi.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm sure... I'm sure it's Ryuji.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The risk of keeping a werewolf is higher than the risk of executing a villager today. I trust Daisuke.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,A pity. You're all falling for a simple bluff.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Ryuji! Get out!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,You are making a grave mistake.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
